# Video masters (/media). Camera originals live here and NEVER ship: anything
# under public/ is copied verbatim into dist/ and deployed, so a 139 MB master
# parked there would go straight to production. Only the web cut it produces
# (public/assets/painter-loop.mp4, ~10 MB) is committed and served.
# Regenerate that cut with: node scripts/encodePainterVideo.mjs
/media/
